{"unit_id":"hwc66626__deepseek-orchestrator#card-zh","repo":"hwc66626/deepseek-orchestrator","commit":"103669b33a88cb7e0284026503cbc83b31ecbb31","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DeepSeek Orchestrator 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的插件，通过注册 ds_* 工具和设置界面，把 DeepSeek 模型接入任务处理流程。它依据任务描述进行离线规则分级，再按需组合思考、执行、独立审查和有限轮次的修复回流；也可分别调用路由预览、思考、执行、审查、配置查看、环境体检和连通性检查。插件适合希望把编码或分析任务交给不同模型角色处理，并查看审查结果的 DSH 用户。需要配置 DeepSeek API Key，模型请求会发送到配置的 DeepSeek API 地址。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh/host.js:335-386","src/router.js:101-160","src/orchestrator.js:152-180","src/client.js:39-66"]}
{"unit_id":"hwc66626__deepseek-orchestrator#card-en","repo":"hwc66626/deepseek-orchestrator","commit":"103669b33a88cb7e0284026503cbc83b31ecbb31","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DeepSeek Orchestrator adds tools and a settings card to DSH Web. Offline rules route tasks to planning, implementation, independent review, and bounded repairs. Users can preview routing or call roles directly. A DeepSeek API key is required; model requests go to the configured API endpoint.","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh/host.js:335-386","src/router.js:101-160","src/orchestrator.js:152-180","src/client.js:39-66"]}
