{"unit_id":"hwc66626__deepseek-orchestrator#feature-1","repo":"hwc66626/deepseek-orchestrator","commit":"103669b33a88cb7e0284026503cbc83b31ecbb31","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DeepSeek Orchestrator 的功能「任务自动分级」：根据任务文本中的规则信号离线估算难度，并返回 L1、L2 或 L3 及对应流水线。可通过 ds_route 预览，也可由 ds_auto 自动触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/router.js:101-160","dsh/host.js:341-359"]}
{"unit_id":"hwc66626__deepseek-orchestrator#feature-2","repo":"hwc66626/deepseek-orchestrator","commit":"103669b33a88cb7e0284026503cbc83b31ecbb31","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DeepSeek Orchestrator 的功能「多角色自动流水线」：ds_auto 根据分级结果组合思考者、执行者和审查者，并在审查未通过时按配置进行有限轮次修复。输入任务和可选上下文，产出结果及审查记录。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/orchestrator.js:152-180","dsh/host.js:361-384"]}
{"unit_id":"hwc66626__deepseek-orchestrator#feature-3","repo":"hwc66626/deepseek-orchestrator","commit":"103669b33a88cb7e0284026503cbc83b31ecbb31","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DeepSeek Orchestrator 的功能「Web 插件设置卡片」：DSH Web 设置页提供 API 地址、角色模型、思考力度、阈值和重试等字段编辑。用户保存配置后由 Host 同步到配置文件，工具调用读取更新后的配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh/client.js:655-679","dsh/host.js:45-61","dsh/host.js:97-108"]}
{"unit_id":"hwc66626__deepseek-orchestrator#caveat-1","repo":"hwc66626/deepseek-orchestrator","commit":"103669b33a88cb7e0284026503cbc83b31ecbb31","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DeepSeek Orchestrator 使用前须知：模型调用需要配置 DEEPSEEK_API_KEY，任务内容会随请求发送到配置的 DeepSeek API 地址。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:39-66"]}
